flowchart TD
    CLI[Interactive CLI] --> Runtime[CliRuntime]
    Runner[residency-run plans] --> Controller[ResidencyController]
    Runtime --> Controller

    Controller --> AdapterAPI[BackendStateAdapter interface]

    AdapterAPI --> Llama[LlamaResidencyAdapter]
    AdapterAPI --> OnnxLLM[OnnxLlmResidencyAdapter]
    AdapterAPI --> OnnxTensor[ONNX tensor backend]

    Llama --> LlamaCpp[llama.cpp model/context]
    OnnxLLM --> ORT[ONNX Runtime Session + IoBinding]
    OnnxLLM --> Tokenizer[tokenizers-cpp tokenizer.json]
    OnnxLLM --> Embed[Optional sibling embedding ONNX]
    OnnxTensor --> ORTTensor[ONNX Runtime tensor workload]

    Llama --> HostState[Pinned host state buffer]
    OnnxLLM --> HostState
    OnnxTensor --> Boundary[CUDA boundary tensors]

    HostState --> Restore[Restore saved backend state]
    Boundary --> Lifecycle[Lifecycle / boundary ownership only]
